127
00:10:27,116 --> 00:10:30,399
For the rest, blame not stub too hardly.

128
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:34,795
The thing is common in that fishery, and in the sequel of the narrative, it will

129
00:10:34,796 --> 00:10:40,915
